{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.designtokens.org/2025-10-01/draft.json",
  "$description": "wcp.finance.* -- an engine-facing CSS custom-property namespace (--ps-wcp-finance-*) for the tool-proforma-engine Rust renderer's self-contained, offline-generated compliance documents. EVERY leaf here is a pure DTCG alias to an already-canonical paper.semantic.financial-report-layout.* token -- no literal values are restated. This is deliberate: the originating draft (project-proforma DESIGN-TOKEN-CHANGE-wcp-finance-bundle, 2026-06-14/2026-07-23) proposed a second, hand-authored literal-value copy of the same V5 canonical values; landing that as written would recreate the exact two-copies-drift failure this design system's token consolidation exists to prevent (see .agent/rules/design-tokens.md). Aliasing keeps paper.semantic.financial-report-layout.* the single source of truth -- a future engine-side codegen step (xtask, not yet built) can regenerate a compiled-in Rust CONST mirror directly from this file's resolved export, which is what the originating draft's 'self-contained offline HTML' requirement actually needs, without a second hand-maintained source. Brand-neutral by construction (document greys/type, no tenant color spine) -- reusable by any document generated on the financial-report-layout / proforma-vehicle-layout family, not Woodfine-specific.",
